menu-item-5620\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D5618.html\">Other</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children menu-item-5607\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4009.html&amp;anchor=0\">Donate</a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4062\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3937.html\">How to Donate</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4061\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3973.html\">Partners</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4059\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3940.html\">FAQ</a></li>\n<li class=\"lang-item lang-item-69 lang-item-ko lang-item-first menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-5632-ko\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3298.html\" hreflang=\"ko-KR\" lang=\"ko-KR\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"한국어\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 11px;\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></li>\n</ul>\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>  </header>\n<!-- = Page banner area start = \\-->\n<section class=\"grop-banner-area grop-page_banner_height-200 \" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;./archive/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/3_banner_lawbooks.jpg&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center center; background-size: cover; background-attachment: ;\">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"grop-full_height  container\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"grop-vertical_middle  text-uppercase  grop-page_title\">Canadian Legal Information Booklets</h2>\n\t</div>\n\t<!--banner overly start\\-->\n\t<div class=\"grop-page_banr_overly_opc-30\"></div><!--/banner overly end-->\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"grop-page container padding-cnt-no grop-full-width\" style=\"\">\n\t<div class=\"no-sidebar\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><div data-vc-full-width=\"true\" data-vc-full-width-init=\"false\" class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid grop-dhav-dotted vc_custom_1604770140675 vc_row-has-fill vc_row-o-content-middle vc_row-flex\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container text-center vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner vc_custom_1604770152979\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_raw_code wpb_content_element wpb_raw_html vc_custom_1784923238182 text-uppercase\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div style=\"font-size:16px;\">\nIf you are looking for Canadian Law in English, please, visit \n<b><a href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/resource-catalogue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\"The CLEO Website\"</a></b>.\n<br><br>\nFor a more detailed legal support, you can also visit <b><a href=\"https://stepstojustice.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\"Steps To Justice\"</a></b>.\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix\"></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid grop-dhav-dotted vc_custom_1586888485187\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container text-left vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner \"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_wp_custommenu wpb_content_element submenu_faq\"><div class=\"widget widget_nav_menu\"><div class=\"menu-%ec%ba%90%eb%82%98%eb%8b%a4-%eb%b2%95%eb%a5%a0%ec%a0%95%eb%b3%b4-%ec%b1%85%ec%9e%90-en-container\"><ul id=\"menu-%ec%ba%90%eb%82%98%eb%8b%a4-%eb%b2%95%eb%a5%a0%ec%a0%95%eb%b3%b4-%ec%b1%85%ec%9e%90-en-1\" class=\"menu\"><li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page current-menu-item page_item page-item-4009 current_page_item menu-item-4021\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4009.html\" aria-current=\"page\">주택임대차법</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4022\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3966.html\">가정법</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4020\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4006.html\">고용과 근로</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4019\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4007.html\">사회보장과 복지</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4018\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4008.html\">이민법</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4017\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4010.html\">형법</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4848\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4844.html\">학대와 가정폭력</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4872\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4867.html\">유언장과 위임장</a></li>\n</ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid grop-dhav-dotted vc_custom_1586888078038\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container text-left vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner vc_custom_1696012231954\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">    <div class=\"grop-project_grid_area\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"grop-filter_content_warp\">\n\n          <!-- Project Filter -->\n          \n          <!-- Project Start -->\n          <div class=\"grop-filter_content  grop-projctfilter_content\" data-restored-grid=\"\">\n\n                        <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-4  grop-project-6ad190fb671e9 category-1 \">\n              <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n                <!--project Media box start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n                  <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2978.html\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_8fightEv.jpg\" alt=\"퇴거 명령에 대한 대처법\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                  </a>\n\n                </div><!--/end-->\n\n                <!--project content text start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n                  <h4>\n                    <a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2978.html\">퇴거 명령에 대한 대처법</a>\n                  </h4>\n                  <p>이 자료는 집을 떠나거나 퇴거 당하고 싶지 않은 경우 세입자가 해야 할 일, 집주인 및 임차인위원회 청문회에서 어떤 일이 일어나는지, 이사회에서 퇴거 명령을 받는 경우 세입자가 할 수 있는 일을 설명합니다. 더 자세한 정보나 법적 도움을 얻을 수 있는 연락처 정보도 있습니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/fightev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3415/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n                  <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n                  <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2978.html\">\n                    <span>자세히 보기</span>\n                  </a><!--/end-->\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-4  grop-project-6ad190fb671e9 category-1 \">\n              <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n                <!--project Media box start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n                  <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2928.html\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_7yourStuff.jpg\" alt=\"임대인이 세입자의 물건을 처분할 수 있을까요?\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                  </a>\n\n                </div><!--/end-->\n\n                <!--project content text start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n                  <h4>\n                    <a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2928.html\">임대인이 세입자의 물건을 처분할 수 있을까요?</a>\n                  </h4>\n                  <p>이 소책자는 이사하거나 퇴거시킬 때 뒤에 남겨둘 개인 재산에 대해 집주인이 해야 할 일을 알려줍니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/yourstuff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3403/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n                  <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n                  <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2928.html\">\n                    <span>자세히 보기</span>\n                  </a><!--/end-->\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-4  grop-project-6ad190fb671e9 category-1 \">\n              <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n                <!--project Media box start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n                  <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2925.html\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_6rentIncs.jpg\" alt=\"임대료 인상\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                  </a>\n\n                </div><!--/end-->\n\n                <!--project content text start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n                  <h4>\n                    <a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2925.html\">임대료 인상</a>\n                  </h4>\n                  <p>세입자의 집세를 늘리려면 집주인은 주거용 주택법에 의해 정해진 규칙을 따라야합니다. 이 자료는 이러한 규칙을 설명합니다. 또한 집주인과 세입자가 임대료를 높이기 위해 할증료 및 기타 요금에 관한 규칙을 세울 수 있고, 세입자가 불법 임대료를 청구 할 경우 취할 수있는 조치에 대해 설명합니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/rentincs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3399/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n                  <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n                  <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2925.html\">\n                    <span>자세히 보기</span>\n                  </a><!--/end-->\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-4  grop-project-6ad190fb671e9 category-1 \">\n              <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n                <!--project Media box start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n                  <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2907.html\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_5moving.jpg\" alt=\"이사 나가기\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                  </a>\n\n                </div><!--/end-->\n\n                <!--project content text start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n                  <h4>\n                    <a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2907.html\">이사 나가기</a>\n                  </h4>\n                  <p>이 자료는 이사하는 경우 세입자가 해야 할 일과 규칙을 준수하지 않을 경우 발생할 수있는 상황을 설명합니다. 일찍 퇴거하는 방법을 다루는 섹션이 있습니다. 집주인과 계약을 맺고, 집주인을 임명하고, 집주인과 세입자위원회에 신청하는 방법입니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/moving-notice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3392/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n                  <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n                  <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2907.html\">\n                    <span>자세히 보기</span>\n                  </a><!--/end-->\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-4  grop-project-6ad190fb671e9 category-1 \">\n              <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n                <!--project Media box start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n                  <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2860.html\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_4mainReps.jpg\" alt=\"유지 보수 및 수리\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                  </a>\n\n                </div><!--/end-->\n\n                <!--project content text start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n                  <h4>\n                    <a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2860.html\">유지 보수 및 수리</a>\n                  </h4>\n                  <p>모든 세입자는 청결하고 안전한 건물에서 잘 유지되는 집에 대한 권리를 가집니다. 이 자료는 집주인이 해야하는 유지 보수 및 수리 유형을 설명하고, 세입자가 물건을 고치기위해 취할 수있는 단계 및 세입자가 도움을받을 수있는 방법을 설명합니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/mainreps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3386/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n                  <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n                  <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2860.html\">\n                    <span>자세히 보기</span>\n                  </a><!--/end-->\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-4  grop-project-6ad190fb671e9 category-1 \">\n              <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n                <!--project Media box start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n                  <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2899.html\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_2harassE.jpg\" alt=\"괴롭힘 및 차별\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                  </a>\n\n                </div><!--/end-->\n\n                <!--project content text start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n                  <h4>\n                    <a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2899.html\">괴롭힘 및 차별</a>\n                  </h4>\n                  <p>세입자는 프라이버시에 대한 법적 권리와 집주인이나 다른 세입자의 괴롭힘과 차별을 당하지 않을 권리가 있습니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/harass-e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3348/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n                  <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n                  <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2899.html\">\n                    <span>자세히 보기</span>\n                  </a><!--/end-->\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"grop-filter_single_col  grop-projctfilter_col bpw-col-4  grop-project-6ad190fb671e9 category-1 \">\n              <div class=\"grop-projct_itm_warp\">\n                <!--project Media box start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_media_box\">\n                  <a class=\"grop-cause_media_img\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2897.html\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/book_housing_1careHome.jpg\" alt=\"간병시설\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                  </a>\n\n                </div><!--/end-->\n\n                <!--project content text start \\-->\n                <div class=\"grop-projct_content_warp\">\n                  <h4>\n                    <a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2897.html\">간병시설</a>\n                  </h4>\n                  <p>간호 주택은 건강 관리 서비스, 간병 서비스 또는 일상 생활에 도움이 되는 임대 주택입니다. 이 간행물은 누군가가 간병인 임차인인지 알아보고 간병인의 권리를 설명합니다. 정보 패키지, 임차 계약, 임대료, 서비스 및 퇴거 등과 같은 주제를 다룹니다.\n</p><div class=\"project-link\">\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-en\" href=\"https://www.cleo.on.ca/en/publications/carehome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<span>원문보기</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"grop-btn project-link-down\" href=\"./archive/download/3325/document.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" type=\"application/pdf\" data-document=\"pdf\">\n<span>다운받기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n                  <!--  project btn start  \\-->\n                  <a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-vpjct_btn\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2897.html\">\n                    <span>자세히 보기</span>\n                  </a><!--/end-->\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            \n          </div>\n          <!-- Project End -->\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n            <div class=\"text-center grop-posts-pagination-warp\">\n    <nav class=\"navigation pagination\">\n      <div class=\"nav-links\">\n            </div>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n    </div>\n\n    </div></div></div></div><div data-vc-full-width=\"true\" data-vc-full-width-init=\"false\" class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid grop-dhav-dotted vc_custom_1695996995585 vc_row-has-fill\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container text-left vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner vc_custom_1695996988633\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"grop-callout_area  grop-parlx-6ad190fb68c8b\"><div class=\"grop-vertical_middle  grop-fix grop-callout_container   vc_custom_1504683801218\"><div class=\"grop-cta-cnt style-two\"><div class=\"text-left text-uppercase  grop-hm3callout_txt\"><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-2748 alignleft\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/ic_law.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"75\" loading=\"lazy\">If you have not found a solution from Canadian Legal Information Booklets or need further assistance from our attorneys, please submit your questions through “Service request.”<br>\nPlease make sure you have personal information of both yourself and the other party you are dealing with in your inquiry. It is to prevent any conflict of interests may occur.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"grop-float_right grop-callout_btn_warp\"><div class=\"calout-btn\"><a class=\"grop-btn grop-btn_overly grop-callout_btn grop-btn-6ad190fb68d53-contact-us   vc_custom_1604265289823\" href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4039.html\"><span>Contact Us</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix\"></div>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- Content Area -->\n\t</div>\n\n\t<footer class=\"grop-footer_area\">\n\t\t<!-- Footer Widgets -->\n<div class=\"grop-footer_top_widgets_warp\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row grop-footer_widgets\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\"><div class=\"footer-title-2 grop-ftr_sngl_widget vt-text-widget\"><h4 class=\"grop-ftr_widget_title\">Love Toronto</h4><p class=\"grop-txt-block \">Charitable Organization 70955 4893 RR 0001</p>\n<p class=\"grop-txt-block \">#204-5915 Leslie Street, North York, ON M2H 1J8</p>\n<address class=\"grop-ftr_wigt_locn \"><span class=\" grop-footer-adrs-6ad190fb69629\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:lovetoronto.office@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">lovetoro